    "word": "telekinesis",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d81b8e5f-9ddc-364e-911a-1412c67d3393",
                "word": "telekinesis",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "14e6776a-2d4c-4de2-90bd-f4c92ca5c222",
                        "entry_id": "d81b8e5f-9ddc-364e-911a-1412c67d3393",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "telekineses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                        "entry_id": "d81b8e5f-9ddc-364e-911a-1412c67d3393",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The ability to move objects with the power of one's mind."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ed45b56-4b55-4e7c-9dae-62e10176fbab",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "Telekinetic energy, which has been variously designated as psychic force (Sir William Crookes), ectenic force (Professor Thury), and telekinesis (Professor Cowes), is demonstrably a power or faculty of the subjective mind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d38b11a-507e-4bed-91cc-75908722f897",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "And this brings me to a consideration of how the phenomena of telekinesis may conceivably be produced — granting that the phenomena are ever genuine at all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "708a9e5a-0406-46ed-aaba-d3dc3294f880",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "He leant tensely against the corridor wall and frowned like a man trying to unbend a corkscrew by telekinesis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5431970-5957-4f68-b2dd-3d8ebd0b0c65",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "'Venison' he declared, mentally lifting the animal through the air toward him without a second thought to the act, though telekinesis was a spell that hadn't been in the considerable repertoire of Morkai the Red."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7f3ac98-7271-4d59-9140-5c68ee1a420a",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "She regards telekinesis as impossible and claims for it as generally fraudulent. For two years she worked in a university laboratory testing telekinesis,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c1b59b2-57d5-4ef6-8b1b-b78203960b61",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "Perhaps the most famous demonstrations of telekinesis came in the 1970s when a young psychic from Russia named Uri Geller came to prominence for his ability to bend spoons and other metal objects without any physical contact."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16162373-feb5-4efc-ba4c-2f5b88047ea1",
                                "sense_id": "277c14b0-cf7e-3e26-8af3-9f8a01eefe90",
                                "text": "And if voice-activated control isn't enough, we could someday use telekinesis to control lights with our thoughts."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0df7b144-2d9d-30d6-a7d3-fb6337c37885",
                        "entry_id": "d81b8e5f-9ddc-364e-911a-1412c67d3393",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instance of use of such power."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
